t single-step quality on par with long-horizon optimizers is an ambitious long-term goal. SCDS represents a substantial and significant step toward that goal by making single-shot sampling feasible and providing a knob to balance cost and fidelity. We will revise the manuscript to more forcefully articulate this perspective on novelty and significance, ensuring our claims are both accurate and compelling."
